1
00:00:00,542 --> 00:00:02,085
Are you two
really dating?

2
00:00:03,629 --> 00:00:05,297
I'm asking
if it's serious

3
00:00:06,131 --> 00:00:07,883
Did I ask something
too obvious?

4
00:00:08,467 --> 00:00:09,823
Okay then, I'm asking you

5
00:00:09,907 --> 00:00:11,929
because you're
in a relationship

6
00:00:12,054 --> 00:00:13,972
with our leading actor

7
00:00:16,058 --> 00:00:17,338
Do you have plans
for the future?

8
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,688
First of all, I'm gonna
leave the company

9
00:00:21,813 --> 00:00:23,081
Well, this time

10
00:00:23,165 --> 00:00:25,108
I'm asking you
as the president of JY

11
00:00:26,652 --> 00:00:27,444
What do you think
of our agency?

12
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:28,569
[President
Lim Jeong-yeon]

13
00:00:28,612 --> 00:00:30,781
I'm not just
feeling you out

14
00:00:30,906 --> 00:00:33,325
We're extending
the business next year

15
00:00:33,575 --> 00:00:36,036
scouting some
new actors

16
00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:38,205
Don't take it
too seriously

17
00:00:39,915 --> 00:00:41,375
Think about it
and call me later

18
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:46,003
Ah

19
00:00:47,089 --> 00:00:48,089
Merry Christmas

20
00:01:00,644 --> 00:01:04,273
Excuse me
I don't usually do this…

21
00:01:05,524 --> 00:01:06,524
Me?

22
00:01:08,151 --> 00:01:11,488
If you don't mind
can I have your number?

23
00:01:11,613 --> 00:01:12,906
- Ah, my number…
- Honey!

24
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:15,409
What's taking so long?

25
00:01:17,661 --> 00:01:18,954
Oh, I'm sorry

26
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,079
Have a good time

27
00:01:23,834 --> 00:01:24,626
What are you doing?

28
00:01:24,835 --> 00:01:26,336
I shouldn't
leave you alone

29
00:01:26,712 --> 00:01:28,046
Hey, what are you saying?

30
00:01:29,589 --> 00:01:30,716
Let's go to my place
